# Managed by Ansible, role `base`. Manual edits are overwritten.
#
# Named `10-` to be read before cloud-init's `50-cloud-init.conf`: sshd
# keeps the first value it sees for a given directive, so this file has the
# final say over whatever the installer left behind.
#
# The key this role authorizes is the only way into the machine: the root
# account is locked and there is no password to fall back on.

PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
